OL,3,ABurnham to meet German chancellor in
OL,4,ABerlin to discuss security and EU ties
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham will hold talks on
OL,7,Ftackling cyber-security threats and
OL,8,Fsabotage with German Chancellor
OL,9,FFriedrich Merz later.
OL,11,FDowning Street said deeper co-operation
OL,12,Fin the face of rising hybrid threats
OL,13,Ffrom Russia would be high on the agenda
OL,14,Fduring Burnham's first official visit
OL,15,Fto Germany.
OL,17,FIntelligence services in both countries
OL,18,Fhave warned of rising threats,
OL,19,Fincluding last month when Germany
OL,20,Faccused Russia of launching a drone
OL,21,Ffitted with explosives at Leipzig/Halle
OL,22,FAirport.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
